ga32(){return"\u2022 Founder / Tech Lead at Probox Studio; product and engineering ownership\n\u2022 Code Reviewer (KMP + Compose): AI PR review for Azure DevOps, GitHub, GitLab and Bitbucket\n\u2022 Sentry.io error monitoring and crash reporting in Code Reviewer (KMP desktop: macOS, Windows and Linux)\n\u2022 Side-by-side diff, draft comments, configurable tech stack; desktop macOS, Windows and Linux\n\u2022 GitHub Actions CI/CD: parallel Mac/Linux/Windows builds, shippable bundle verification, auto-update manifest\n\u2022 Release publish to CodeReviewer-releases; Gemini and OpenAI providers\n\u2022 Flutter Web portfolio: analyze, unit tests, build web, deploy to www.proboxstudio.com.br via Portfolio-releases"},
ga2X(){return"\u2022 Full redesign of The Philadelphia Inquirer news app on Android (Jetpack Compose) and iOS (SwiftUI)\n\u2022 Planning, design and ideation contribution, especially Ads monetization and native UX\n\u2022 Hands-on native development, performance and release readiness across both platforms"},
ga31(){return"\u2022 Tech Lead Mobile for Flutter team; apps activOS, MovidaExpress, GeoFleet, GeoFleetClient, SatDesignSystem and FlavorCreator\n\u2022 Architecture: flutter_modular + BloC/Cubit, Riverpod, Provider and GetX in legacy apps\n\u2022 Built 100% of GeoFleetClient CI/CD on Azure DevOps: Conventional Commits, LOC gate, analyze/style\n\u2022 SonarQube in Azure DevOps pipelines: static analysis, quality gates and PR quality enforcement\n\u2022 Unit tests with \u226590% per-file coverage on PR diffs, JUnit in Azure, Pigeon/build_runner codegen\n\u2022 Fastlane (APK/AAB/IPA), Play/App Store publish, Firebase App Distribution dev/prod (Android + iOS), auto tagging\n\u2022 Reusable Flutter CI/CD template (init_project.sh) for new apps"},
ga33(){return"\u2022 Participated in the corporate banking (PJ) app revamp at Banco Santander via F1rst\n\u2022 Untangled a fragile multi-module Android architecture where modules did not compile together\n\u2022 Addressed circular dependencies with the main app module, the only host injecting implementations required by external modules\n\u2022 External modules only worked inside the main app; standalone samples failed because key dependencies existed only in the host\n\u2022 Helped create the modularization pipeline and advance module boundaries and dependency-injection restructuring\n\u2022 Left before the revamp was fully completed"},
ga2Z(){return"\u2022 Hands-on technical leader on mobile Ads platform for Magalu, Netshoes and Zattini\n\u2022 Led Android and iOS Ads SDK architecture, integration contracts and version compatibility\n\u2022 Clean Architecture, MVI, modularization; trunk-based development, CI/CD and regression control\n\u2022 SonarQube static analysis and quality gates on Ads SDK Android/iOS repositories and CI/CD\n\u2022 Crash, ANR and metrics reliability; collaboration with Product, Business and app teams\n\u2022 AI-assisted engineering (Cursor, Copilot, Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini) for legacy code and test generation"},
ga2Y(){return"\u2022 Mobile Systems Engineer for Glooko healthcare glucose monitoring; fully in English, distributed team\n\u2022 Native Android and iOS technical lead inside React Native ecosystem\n\u2022 Sentry.io crash reporting and error monitoring in iPEP Mobile (React Native, multiple healthcare flavors)\n\u2022 BLE integration with medical devices; reliability, security and data accuracy in healthcare context\n\u2022 Technical documentation for native-hybrid flows, device behavior and troubleshooting"},
ga34(){return"\u2022 Led Android/iOS integration with Amazon IVS live streaming for doctors-only social network\n\u2022 Flutter Platform Channels bridge; stability, video quality and maintainable integration boundaries\n\u2022 Technical mentoring on Flutter-native integration, architecture and code quality"},
ga2V(){return"\u2022 Android/iOS technical reference for high-criticality banking apps, including Bradesco Net Empresas (iOS)\n\u2022 Refactored NDK check-deposit SDK from ~50MB to ~6MB preserving functionality\n\u2022 SonarQube static analysis and quality gates on high-criticality banking mobile codebases\n\u2022 PoCs: NFC ATM payments, Firebase ML Kit barcode, CameraX, LUMA analysis, OCR/liveness\n\u2022 Technical forums, cross-platform discussions, impact studies and internal documentation"},
ga2W(){return"\u2022 Owned white-label telemetry capture SDKs for Android and iOS (sensors, GPS, BLE, connectivity)\n\u2022 Driver behavior algorithms: trip start/end, harsh braking, acceleration, speeding and elevation\n\u2022 REST integrations, Bluetooth, Protobuf, field firmware updates and real-road validation"},
ga3_(){return"\u2022 Mobile technical reference for OCR, biometrics, facial recognition and identity validation (financial sector)\n\u2022 Framework for Brazilian ID, tax ID and driver license capture with automatic image-quality validation\n\u2022 Real-time liveness detection reducing manual document rejection by ~96%\n\u2022 Document analysis PoCs for Banco Original, Itau and Telefonica/Vivo"},
ga30(){return"\u2022 Built Android applications for hospitality, booking, financial-market data and sales-force automation, including smartphone/tablet support, adaptive interfaces and offline-first synchronization.\n\u2022 Contributed to a reusable white-label Android codebase that enabled approximately 40 hotel apps with centralized evolution, brand-specific customization and lower maintenance cost.\n\u2022 Implemented real-time financial ticker UI updates, backend integrations, local storage, Windows Azure synchronization and early Android production support responsibilities."},
